{"type":"npc","name":"Waltzing Willow","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":220,"temp":0,"max":220,"details":""},"ac":{"value":33,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":20,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"weaknesses":[{"type":"axe-vulnerability","value":10,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"fire","value":15,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"bludgeoning","value":10,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]},{"type":"slashing","value":10,"exceptions":[],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["arboreal","common","spirituan"],"details":"Can't speak any language"},"level":{"value":12},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Willow trees are symbols of both loss and rebirth. On rare occasions, willows that watch over a settlement's festivals and rites can absorb a portion of the settlement's collective consciousness. By gathering fragments of communal song, these trees develop minds of their own and the ability to manifest a quartet of spirits. Though the spirits spend much of their time caught up in their performances, they experience occasional moments of clarity. During these times, the spirits can speak. However, their guidance is often cryptic and poetic in nature, blending the past and present freely into a tangled tale.</p><h2>Playing Favorites</h2><p>Waltzing willows who oversee a village usually have a few favorites: kind souls who dedicate their lives to the community, or loners who confide their troubles under the willow's eaves. When these favorites are threatened, even by other villagers, the willows take action, though often in plausibly deniable ways. Many a bully has mysteriously broken a limb while climbing a willow tree, with none the wiser as to the cause—although sharp-eyed observers might notice that the willow's branches seem to have changed configuration.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 250/560/1,030 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), shield, skill items (Athletics, Nature, Occultism, Performance, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, bane, charisma, constitution, elongating, energy resistant (vitality), intelligence, light, mind, mind shield, music, sensory (low-light vision), spells (Occult: @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.szIyEsvihc5e1w8n]{Soothe}), spirit, strength, sturdy, tangle shield, time, wild, wood</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Austin Smith","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":7},"int":{"mod":5},"wis":{"mod":4},"cha":{"mod":5}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":22,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":25,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":19,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":22,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":25,"special":[]},"nature":{"base":22,"special":[]},"occultism":{"base":25,"special":[]},"performance":{"base":25,"special":[]},"stealth":{"base":19,"special":[{"label":"in forests","predicate":["terrain:forest"],"base":25}]}},"traits":{"value":["plant"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"huge"}}},"_id":"Lp7wnIL4pwfdfCVm","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/waltzing-willow.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Waltzing Willow","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":3,"height":3,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/waltzing-willow.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/waltzing-willow.webp"}},"flags":{"sf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"name":"Occult Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":21,"dc":29},"tradition":{"value":"occult"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"O0TfSS2LD16Nh0ZO","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"