:"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You or an ally within 60 feet rolls a saving throw against an auditory or visual effect.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Your performance protects you and your allies. Roll a @Check[performance] check for a type you know—it must be an auditory performance if the trigger was auditory or a visual one for a visual trigger, and this action gains the traits for the type of performance. You and allies in the area can use the better result between your Performance check and the saving throw.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"counter-performance","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["bard","composition","concentrate","fortune","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"emanation","value":60},"time":{"value":"reaction"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"O0TfSS2LD16Nh0ZO","heightenedLevel":6,"uses":{"max":2,"value":1}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.WILXkjU5Yq3yw10r","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"GTF27QGPPvkOjz8i"},{"folder":"wnvibtD90h7CStDC","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/inspire-courage.webp","name":"Courageous Anthem","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You inspire yourself and your allies with words or tunes of encouragement. You and all allies in the area gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, damage rolls, and saves against fear effects.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spell-effects.Item.beReeFroAx24hj83]{Spell Effect: Courageous Anthem}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"courageous-anthem","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["bard","cantrip","composition","concentrate","emotion","mental"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"emanation","value":60},"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"1 round","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"O0TfSS2LD16Nh0ZO","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.IAjvwqgiDr3qGYxY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"bSQfpurR7arKMOOH"},{"folder":"wnvibtD90h7CStDC","img":"icons/creatures/mammals/wolf-howl-moon-black.webp","name":"Dirge of Doom","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Enemies within the area are @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}. They can't reduce their frightened value below 1 while they remain in the area.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dirge-of-doom","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["bard","cantrip","composition","concentrate","emotion","fear","mental"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"emanation","value":30},"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"1 round","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"O0TfSS2LD16Nh0ZO","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.1xLVcA8Y1onw7toT","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"aHrkAqrok1E6czma"},{"folder":"wnvibtD90h7CStDC","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/inspire-defense.webp","name":"Rallying Anthem","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Your song moves allies to protect themselves more effectively. You and all allies in the area gain a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws, as well as resistance equal to half the spell's rank to physical damage.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spell-effects.Item.DLwTvjjnqs2sNGuG]{Spell Effect: Rallying Anthem}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"rallying-anthem","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["bard","cantrip","composition","concentrate","emotion","mental"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":[]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"emanation","value":60},"time":{"value":"1"},"duration":{"value":"1 round","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"O0TfSS2LD16Nh0ZO","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.bH0kPuf7UKxRvi2P","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"VSKpTO4g5WP9skey"},{"img":"icons/tools/instruments/lute-gold-brown.webp","name":"Musical Instrument (Virtuoso handheld)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Handheld instruments include bagpipes, a small set of chimes, small drums, fiddles and viols, flutes and recorders, small harps, lutes, trumpets, and similarly sized instruments. The GM might rule that an especially large handheld instrument (like a tuba) has greater Bulk. Heavy instruments such as large drums, a full set of chimes, and keyboard instruments are less portable and generally need to be stationary while played.</p>\n<p>A virtuoso instrument is more finely made and gives a +1 item bonus to Performance checks using that instrument.</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"performance","key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.PlayingItem","option":"playing","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":["playing"],"selector":"performance","type":"item","value":1}],"slug":"musical-instrument-virtuoso-handheld","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":3},"quantity":4,"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":1},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":50}},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"containerId":null,"size":"huge","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"","img":"","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"subitems":[]},"type":"equipment","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.equipment.Item.3ld14dsn2RLu9owg","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"4ArIfbdqPBw5Evjf"},{"type":"action","name":"Death of Music","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Whenever a creature kills a waltzing willow, it must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:29] save or become cursed. While cursed in this way, the creature can no longer hear music at all. The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} only to instruments and sung voices and the creature can no longer benefit from composition spells.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["curse","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"OG3CEH0F73lIs1fp","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Branch","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["reach-15"]},"damageRolls":{"PJkYEVAsaAmeMgDp":{"damage":"3d10+13","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":26},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"dW5bbN2ktRblwDtW","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Root","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["agile","reach-10"]},"damageRolls":{"L32r8YmtyrvOfRkW":{"damage":"3d6+13","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":26},"attackEffects":{"value":["improved-knockdown"]}},"_id":"akoDwbIcwTqO37BX","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Improved Knockdown","system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedKnockdown]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"improved-knockdown","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.sf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.LbnsT8yXchHMQT3t","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"Z8LS3HG6B8vBxdci"},{"type":"action","name":"Spirit Lights","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The waltzing willow is surrounded by the glowing spirits of four musicians, which each shed light in a 60-foot radius. Once per round, the willow can spend one action with the concentrate trait to move each spirit up to 60 feet. At the end of each spirit's movement, the willow can attach it to an adjacent creature, who must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:32] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The spirit attaches itself to the creature for 1 round. While the spirit is attached, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled}. If it was invisible, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and if it was already concealed for any other reason, it is no longer concealed.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, except the spirit remains attached for 3 rounds.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, except the spirit remains attached for 1 minute.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["light","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"ij3dpCCmd23mVj0E","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Spotlight","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The waltzing willow fills a @Template[type:burst|distance:30] within 120 feet with light as their spirit's performance swells to a crescendo. All creatures in the spotlight must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:32] save or a @Check[performance|dc:28] check as they are swept into a dance. Waltzing willows are not immune to Spotlight, but they receive the results of a critical success if they roll a success. The Waltzing willow can't use Spotlight again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Spotlight]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target dances exceedingly well. If they rolled a Performance check, they are @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened} from the momentum until the end of its next turn; they can use this extra action only to Stride.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target stumbles over its feet, becoming @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} until the end of the waltzing willow's next turn or until it Steps.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target's dance places horrific strain on its body as it fails to keep up with the music. It takes @Damage[12d6[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage] damage and falls @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target takes double damage.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","emotion","light","mental","occult"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"EuJFbJluwz3uBuPK","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Two Step Waltz","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The waltzing willow Steps twice and can cast a cantrip.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"B97YIedazReqY1gZ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":100391,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}